<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Lefic yr shr falls, awards cap shares.</title>
<headline>Lefic yr shr falls, awards cap shares.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Attrib shr (cts)     26.3	   vs 36.2</p>
<p>    Attrib income	  82.5	   vs 113.8</p>
<p>Share of associates'</p>
<p>     earnings		 82.5	  vs 113.8</p>
<p>Full name: Lewis Foschini Investment Company Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The group will issue capitalisation shares to shareholders registered on June 27 in the ratio of three new fully paid N shares for every 100 ordinary and N shares held. They will be posted on July 4.</p>
<p>Its sole source of income is Foschini Ltd</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
